# Hashes of files installed by earlier experimental/jev releases.
# Format: "<sha256>  <installed relative path>" (one per line; '#' starts a comment).
# uninstall removes leftover "<path>.bak.<utc>.<seq>" files at experimental/jev locations only when
# their content matches the pre-uninstall manifest or one of these hashes. Not installed itself.
# 1.8.0-exp.1: first release, so no earlier hashes are listed.
